sequenceDiagram
  participant Visitor as Visitor browser
  participant LocaleManager as LocaleManager (IC-6)
  participant Router as Next.js Router
  participant Consent as ConsentStore
  participant Analytics as GA4

  Visitor->>LocaleManager: Select "हिन्दी"
  LocaleManager->>Consent: Check consent granted?
  alt consent granted
    LocaleManager->>LocaleManager: Persist cookie locale=hi (180d)
  else no consent
    LocaleManager->>LocaleManager: Skip cookie write
  end
  LocaleManager->>Router: Navigate to /hi
  Router-->>Visitor: Render localized content (fallback to en if missing keys)
  LocaleManager->>Analytics: Emit site.interaction.analytics.v1(language_change)
